{
  "uid": "perfops-blokus-app",
  "title": "PerfOps Blokus — Application Layer (Node.js, WebSocket, Game Engine)",
  "description": "Application metrics grouped by component: Node.js runtime, WebSocket layer, game engine.",
  "tags": [
    "blokus",
    "application",
    "nodejs",
    "perfops"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {
    "refresh_intervals": [
      "10s",
      "30s",
      "1m",
      "5m"
    ]
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "label": "Data source",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "instance",
        "label": "Host",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(nodejs_eventloop_lag_p99_seconds, instance)",
          "refId": "instance"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(nodejs_eventloop_lag_p99_seconds, instance)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "sort": 1,
        "hide": 2
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": {
          "type": "grafana",
          "uid": "-- Grafana --"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "type": "link",
      "title": "OS dashboard (USE)",
      "url": "/d/perfops-blokus-use",
      "icon": "dashboard",
      "targetBlank": false,
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": true
    },
    {
      "type": "link",
      "title": "SLI / SLO dashboard",
      "url": "/d/perfops-blokus-slo",
      "icon": "dashboard",
      "targetBlank": false,
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": true
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "id": 1,
      "title": "NODE.JS RUNTIME",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": 2,
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 2,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Responsiveness"
      },
      "transparent": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": 3,
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Event loop lag (p99)**\n\n- Rising: something blocks the single thread (heavy computation, large JSON work, synchronous code). Every player is affected, and move latency (SLI-3) rises with it.\n- Low and stable: the thread is not blocked, so a latency problem is elsewhere (database, network).\n\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": 4,
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**GC time (share of time spent in garbage collection)**\n\n- High: too many allocations (JSON parsing and stringifying) or a heap that is growing. Code is paused during collections.\n- Low: GC is not the cause of lag.\n\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Event loop lag p99",
      "description": "How late the event loop is for the slowest 1% of work",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "nodejs_eventloop_lag_p99_seconds{instance=~\"$instance\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}} lag p99",
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line"
            }
          },
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.05
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 6,
      "title": "GC time",
      "description": "Seconds per second spent in V8 garbage collection, shown as %",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "rate(nodejs_gc_duration_seconds_sum{instance=~\"$instance\"}[$__rate_interval])*100",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}} GC",
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line"
            }
          },
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 5
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 10
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": 7,
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 2,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Memory"
      },
      "transparent": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": 8,
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Heap used / heap total**\n\n- The floor (the value after each GC) rises over hours: leak of JavaScript objects.\n- Goes up and down with a stable floor: normal allocation and collection.\n\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": 9,
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 18
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**RSS (process_resident_memory_bytes)**\n\n- Rising while the heap is flat: memory outside the heap. Check the buffered amount in the WebSocket section.\n- Rising while heap and external memory are flat: native memory or fragmentation.\n- Stable: no memory growth in the process.\n\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 10,
      "title": "Heap used / heap total",
      "description": "V8 heap usage ratio",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 23
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "nodejs_heap_size_used_bytes{instance=~\"$instance\"} / nodejs_heap_size_total_bytes{instance=~\"$instance\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}} heap used / total",
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line"
            }
          },
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.7
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.85
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 11,
      "title": "RSS vs heap",
      "description": "Process memory from the OS compared with the V8 heap",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 23
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "process_resident_memory_bytes{instance=~\"$instance\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}} RSS",
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "nodejs_heap_size_used_bytes{instance=~\"$instance\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}} heap used",
          "refId": "B",
          "editorMode": "code"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "nodejs_heap_size_total_bytes{instance=~\"$instance\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}} heap total",
          "refId": "C",
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": 12,
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 2,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 31
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Process limits"
      },
      "transparent": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": 13,
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 33
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Process CPU**\n\n- Near 100% (1 core): the process is saturated. More cores will not help a single Node.js instance, so run more instances.\n- Low while latency is high: the bottleneck is not CPU in this process (check the database or network).\n\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": 14,
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 33
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Open file descriptors**\n\n- Near the limit (red dashed line): new connections fail. Either there are too many connections or sockets are not being closed.\n- Far below the limit: descriptors are not a constraint.\n\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 15,
      "title": "Process CPU (1 core = 100%)",
      "description": "CPU time used by the Node.js process per second",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 38
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "rate(process_cpu_seconds_total{instance=~\"$instance\"}[$__rate_interval])*100",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}} CPU",
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line"
            }
          },
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 70
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 85
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 16,
      "title": "Open file descriptors vs limit",
      "description": "Each socket uses one descriptor",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 38
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "process_open_fds{instance=~\"$instance\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}} open fds",
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "process_max_fds{instance=~\"$instance\"}",
          "legendFormat": "Max fds {{instance}}",
          "refId": "B",
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "Max.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.lineStyle",
                "value": {
                  "fill": "dash",
                  "dash": [
                    10,
                    10
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.fillOpacity",
                "value": 0
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.lineWidth",
                "value": 2
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "id": 17,
      "title": "WEBSOCKET LAYER",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 46
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": 18,
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 2,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 47
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Connections"
      },
      "transparent": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": 19,
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 49
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**blokus_active_ws_connections**\n\n- Rising with load: expected. Use it as the reference when comparing CPU, memory and lag to find the knee point.\n- Dropping suddenly: a crash, a deploy, or a mass disconnect. Check the disconnect codes.\n\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": 20,
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 49
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Disconnects by close code**\n\n- Spike of 1006: the network or client dropped abruptly, or the server crashed. Confirm with a drop in SLI-5.\n- Spike of 1008: abusive clients are being kicked (rate limits), which can mean an attack or a client bug.\n- Mostly 1000: normal closes, so connection stability is healthy.\n\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 21,
      "title": "Active WebSocket connections",
      "description": "Current open sockets, the main traffic indicator",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 54
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "blokus_active_ws_connections{instance=~\"$instance\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}} connections",
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 22,
      "title": "Disconnects per second by close code",
      "description": "1000 normal, 1006 abnormal, 1008 policy violation",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 54
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (instance, code)(rate(blokus_ws_disconnects_total{instance=~\"$instance\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}} code {{code}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "suffix: /s",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": 23,
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 2,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 62
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Traffic and backpressure"
      },
      "transparent": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": 24,
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 64
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**blokus_ws_buffered_amount_bytes**\n\n- Growing: slow clients have messages queued in RAM, and memory will eventually run out. RSS rises while the heap stays flat.\n- Near zero: clients are keeping up with the messages sent.\n\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": 25,
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 64
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Messages received per second**\n\n- Rate rising: more traffic, which explains higher CPU or GC.\n- CPU or GC rising while the rate is flat: the cost per message increased, which points to a code change or a heavier message type.\n\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 26,
      "title": "Buffered amount (slow clients)",
      "description": "Sum of ws.bufferedAmount across sockets: data queued in RAM",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 69
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "blokus_ws_buffered_amount_bytes{instance=~\"$instance\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}} buffered",
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
